    "title": "4-dars. Class va Object noldan: VTable va Xotiradagi haqiqat",
    "shortTitle": "4. Class va Virtual Table",
    "summary": "Klass qanday qilib xotirada saqlanadi, method table (vtable) qanday ishlaydi va dinamik dispatch nima.",
    "origin": "Tech Academy Chuqur Nazariya",
