    "title": "7-dars. Blocking, Non-blocking va Asynchronous: I/O Asoslari",
    "shortTitle": "7. Blocking vs Non-blocking",
    "summary": "Sinxron, asinxron, bloklovchi va nobloklovchi arxitektura. OS I/O multiplexing (epoll), va Coroutine suspension bog'lanishi.",
    "origin": "Tech Academy Chuqur Nazariya",
