    "shortTitle": "1. Kotlin va Java",
    "summary": "Java'da bitta oddiy User ma'lumotini saqlash uchun 50 qator getter, setter, constructor, equals yozish kerak edi. Kotlin...",
    "origin": "Tech Academy 0 dan Sodda Tushuntirish",
