    "title": "4-dars. Funksiyalar: extension, lambda, higher-order",
    "shortTitle": "4. Funksiyalar",
    "summary": "Bu darsdan keyin extension funksiya ichkarida qanday ishlashini va lambda nima ekanini tushuntirasiz.",
