    "title": "5-dars. inline, noinline, crossinline va reified",
    "shortTitle": "5. inline / crossinline",
    "summary": "Bu darsdan keyin suhbatda so'ralgan “inline va crossinline farqi” savoliga kod bilan javob berasiz.",
    "origin": "Mavjud qo‘llanmadan",
    "priority": 1,
