    "id": "FL-007",
    "module": "FL",
    "moduleName": "5. Kotlin Flow & Reaktiv Dasturlash",
    "moduleOrder": 5,
    "title": "7-dars. Flow'da xatolar va Thread: catch, flowOn va Context Preservation",
    "shortTitle": "7. Xato va thread",
    "summary": "Bu darsdan keyin flowOn qaysi qismga ta'sir qilishini va catch qaysi xatolarni ushlashini bilasiz.",
    "origin": "Mavjud qo‘llanmadan",
    "priority": 1,
