    "body": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"background:var(--accent2);border-left:5px solid var(--accent);padding:14px;margin-bottom:18px\">\n  <b style=\"color:var(--accent);font-size:15px\">💡 Amaliyotdagi holat:</b>\n  <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0 0;font-size:15px\">Siz Fragment ichida LiveData yoki Flow'ni kuzatyapsiz: <code>flow.collect(this)</code> deb yozdingiz. Qarasangiz, Fragment BackStack'ka tushib qaytib kelgach, bitta hodisa 2 marta, keyin 3 marta, keyin 4 marta chaqirilyapti! Va LeakCanary xotira oqishi haqida bong urmoqda. Nega Fragment'da <b>ikkita alohida hayot sikli</b> bor?</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"AN-003-B01\">1. Muammo nima? Nega Fragment va uning View'i boshqa-boshqa narsa?</h3>\n<p>Activity'da View bilan Activity bir vaqtda tug'iladi va bir vaqtda o'ladi. Lekin Fragment'da unday emas!</p>\n<p>Agar siz Fragment'ni BackStack'ka qo'shsangiz (<code>addToBackStack()</code>) va boshqa ekranga o'tsangiz:\n<br>1. Fragment'ning ekrandagi ko'rinishi (View) xotirani tejash uchun <b>BUTUNLAY YO'Q QILINADI (onDestroyView)</b>!\n<br>2. Lekin Fragment Java/Kotlin obyekti xotirada <b>TIRIK QOLADI</b> (chunki u orqaga qaytish navbatida turibdi)!</p>\n<p>Shuning uchun Fragment'ning o'zining yashash muddati bilan uning ekrandagi View'ining yashash muddati <b>mutlaqo mos kelmaydi</b>!</p>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"AN-003-B02\">2. 'this' vs 'viewLifecycleOwner' (Xatolik siri)</h3>\n<div class=\"two-col\">\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--badborder);background:var(--badbg);padding:14px;border-radius:8px\">\n    <b style=\"color:var(--bad)\">❌ Katta xato (Memory Leak & Multiple events):</b>\n    <pre style=\"margin:8px 0 0 0\"><code>// onViewCreated ichida:\nviewModel.cards.observe(this) { ... }\n// DIQQAT: 'this' bu Fragment'ning o'zi!\n// View o'lib qayta tug'ilsa ham, eski \n// observer tirik qolib, yangisi qo'shilaveradi!</code></pre>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--okborder);background:var(--okbg);padding:14px;border-radius:8px\">\n    <b style=\"color:var(--ok)\">✅ To'g'ri yo'l (viewLifecycleOwner):</b>\n    <pre style=\"margin:8px 0 0 0\"><code>// onViewCreated ichida:\nviewModel.cards.observe(viewLifecycleOwner) { ... }\n// View o'lishi bilan observer avtomatik \n// tostdan tozalab tashlanadi!</code></pre>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"AN-003-B03\">3. View Binding'ni tozalash qoidasi (onDestroyView)</h3>\n<p>Agar siz Fragment'da ViewBinding ishlatsangiz, uning binding o'zgaruvchisini <code>onDestroyView()</code> da majburan <code>null</code> qilish shart:</p>\n<pre><code>private var _binding: FragmentPaymentBinding? = null\nprivate val binding get() = _binding!!\n\noverride fun onDestroyView() {\n    super.onDestroyView()\n    _binding = null // Aks holda View xotirada qolib ketadi (Memory Leak)!\n}</code></pre>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"AN-003-B04\">4. Boshqalarga buni qanday tushuntirasiz? (Interview Plain-talk)</h3>\n<div class=\"say\">\"Fragment ikkita alohida hayot sikliga ega: Fragment'ning o'z hayot sikli va uning View hayot sikli. Fragment Backstack'ka tushganda uning View'i <code>onDestroyView</code> orqali yo'q qilinadi, lekin Fragment obyekti xotirada saqlanib qoladi. Shuning uchun UI bilan bog'liq barcha narsalarni (Flow, LiveData, ViewBinding) kuzatishda Fragment'ning o'ziga emas, balki aynan <code>viewLifecycleOwner</code> ga bog'lash shart, aks holda observer'lar takrorlanishi va Memory Leak yuzaga keladi.\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"deep-section\" id=\"deepSection\">\n  <div class=\"deep-header\">\n    <span class=\"deep-badge\">🔬 Senior darajadagi sir</span>\n    <h4>FragmentTransaction commit vs commitNow vs commitAllowingStateLoss</h4>\n  </div>\n  <h4 data-block-id=\"AN-003-D01\">Nega 'commitAllowingStateLoss' bor?</h4>\n  <p>Agar ilova fonda turganda yoki <code>onSaveInstanceState</code> chaqirilgandan keyin siz <code>transaction.commit()</code> qilsangiz, Android ilovani darhol <code>IllegalStateException: Can not perform this action after onSaveInstanceState</code> bilan yiqitadi! Nega?</p>\n  <p>Chunki tizim Activity holatini allaqachon diskka saqlab bo'lgan, siz esa yangi Fragment qo'shmoqchisiz. Tizim bu yangi Fragment holatini saqlab qolishga kafolat bera olmaydi. <code>commitAllowingStateLoss()</code> esa tizimga: <i>\"Agar holat yo'qolib ketsa ham mayli, xato otmasdan amalni bajaraver\"</i> degan ruxsatni beradi.</p>\n</div>",
    "searchText": "Fragment'da ikki lifecycle: Fragment va uning View'i Yuqori chiziq — Fragment obyekti, pastki — uning View'i. Back stack'da ular ajraladi.  Yuqori chiziq — Fragment obyekti, pastki — uning View'i. Back stack'da ular ajraladi.  Fragment obyekti o'z View'idan uzoqroq yashashi mumkin. Shuning uchun Fragment'da ikki lifecycle bor:  this  (Fragment) va  viewLifecycleOwner  (View). Qoidalar:   View bilan ishlaydigan narsa —  viewLifecycleOwner ga:  observe(viewLifecycleOwner) ,  viewLifecycleOwner.lifecycleScope .  ViewBinding  onDestroyView da  null  qilinadi, aks holda eski View xotirada qoladi.  Ma'lumot yuklash — ViewModel'ning  init ida, Fragment'da emas.   Muhim nuqtalar   Back stack'da onDestroyView chaqiriladi, onDestroy — yo'q.  View'ga bog'liq ish — viewLifecycleOwner'ga.  binding'ni onDestroyView'da null qilish.   Texnik jihatdan shunday tushuntiring  Fragment'da ikki lifecycle bor: Fragment va uning View'i. Back stack'ga ketganda onDestroyView chaqiriladi, onDestroy esa yo'q. Shuning uchun observe va coroutine'larni viewLifecycleOwner'ga bog'layman va binding'ni onDestroyView'da null qilaman. \n \n   \n     🔬 Senior & Under the Hood \n     Chuqur texnik tahlil, apparat va ichki mexanizmlar \n   \n   Ichki mexanizm va arxitektura \n   Ushbu mavzuning apparat, xotira va OS darajasidagi ta'siri: keraksiz obyektlar yaratilishining oldini olish, kesh registrlaridan unumli foydalanish va to'g'ri arxitektura orqali yuqori tezlikka erishish. \n   Senior darajadagi tavsiya va edge case \n   Bank va yuqori yuklamali tizimlarda bu mexanizm bo'yicha eng muhim e'tibor qaratiladigan nuqta — resurslarni o'z vaqtida tozalash va asinxron poyga holatlarining (race conditions) oldini olishdir. \n "
