    "body": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"background:var(--accent2);border-left:5px solid var(--accent);padding:14px;margin-bottom:18px\">\n  <b style=\"color:var(--accent);font-size:15px\">💡 Amaliyotdagi holat:</b>\n  <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0 0;font-size:15px\">Foydalanuvchi bank ilovasida karta raqamini va summani kiritdi. Shu payt unga qo'ng'iroq bo'lib qoldi yoki og'ir o'yinga (PUBG) kirdi. 10 daqiqadan keyin bank ilovasiga qaytib kelsa, ilova qaytadan ochildi va <b>barcha kiritilgan ma'lumotlar yo'q bo'lib ketdi!</b> Nega ViewModel bu holatda qutqara olmadi?</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"AN-005-B01\">1. Configuration Change va Process Death farqi</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;font-size:14px\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"background:var(--panel2);color:#fff\">\n      <th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Xususiyati</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Configuration Change (Ekran aylanishi)</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Process Death (Jarayon o'limi)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>Nima o'ladi?</b></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Faqat Activity obyekti yo'q qilinadi</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>Butun ilova jarayoni (Process) va RAM tozalanadi!</b></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>ViewModel tirik qoladimi?</b></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>HA!</b> ViewModel to'liq tirik qoladi</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">❌ <b>YO'Q!</b> ViewModel ham butunlay yo'q bo'ladi</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>Statik o'zgaruvchilar?</b></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Saqlanib qoladi</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Butunlay o'chib ketadi (Default holatga qaytadi)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>Ma'lumotni nima qutqaradi?</b></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">ViewModel / rememberSaveable</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>SavedStateHandle / onSaveInstanceState</b></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"AN-005-B02\">2. Yechim: 'SavedStateHandle' qanday ishlaydi?</h3>\n<p>Process Death paytida butun xotira o'chib ketishi sababli, ma'lumotlar OS tizim xotirasida (Bundle sifatida) saqlanishi kerak. Jetpack ViewModel buning uchun <b>SavedStateHandle</b> ni taqdim etadi:</p>\n<pre><code>class TransferViewModel(\n    private val savedStateHandle: SavedStateHandle\n) : ViewModel() {\n\n    // 1. O'qish: Agar ilova o'lib qayta tirilsa, saqlangan qiymat olinadi:\n    val recipientCard = savedStateHandle.getStateFlow(\"CARD_KEY\", initialValue = \"\")\n\n    fun onCardEntered(card: String) {\n        // 2. Yozish: Avtomatik Bundle'ga saqlanib boradi!\n        savedStateHandle[\"CARD_KEY\"] = card\n    }\n}</code></pre>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"AN-005-B03\">3. Boshqalarga buni qanday tushuntirasiz? (Interview Plain-talk)</h3>\n<div class=\"say\">\"Configuration change faqat Activity'ni qayta yaratadi va unda ViewModel tirik qoladi. Ammo Process Death yuz berganda (tizim fonda turgan ilovani xotira yetishmovchiligi tufayli o'ldirganda), butun dastur jarayoni va barcha ViewModel'lar yo'q qilinadi. Bunday vaziyatda foydalanuvchi kiritgan vaqtinchalik ma'lumotlarni saqlab qolishning yagona yo'li — bu <code>SavedStateHandle</code> yoki <code>onSaveInstanceState</code> orqali ma'lumotlarni tizim Bundle'iga yozishdir.\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"deep-section\" id=\"deepSection\">\n  <div class=\"deep-header\">\n    <span class=\"deep-badge\">🔬 Senior darajadagi sir</span>\n    <h4>LMK (Low Memory Killer) va Linux oom_adj Score</h4>\n  </div>\n  <h4 data-block-id=\"AN-005-D01\">Android kimni birinchi o'ldirishni qayerdan biladi?</h4>\n  <p>Android Linux yadrosida <b>LMK (Low Memory Killer)</b> drayveri ishlaydi. Har bir ishlayotgan ilovaga uning hozirgi holatiga qarab <b><code>oom_score_adj</code></b> balli beriladi:</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>0 (Foreground App):</b> Hozir ekranda ochiq turgan ilova. Tizim uni eng oxirgi navbatda o'ldiradi.</li>\n    <li><b>100–200 (Visible / Paused):</b> Ekranda qisman ko'rinib turgan ilova (masalan, Split screen yoki Dialog ostida).</li>\n    <li><b>300–400 (Foreground Service):</b> Musiqa ijro etayotgan yoki navigatsiya qilayotgan xizmat.</li>\n    <li><b>900–1000 (Cached Background App):</b> Foydalanuvchi minimallashtirib fonga o'tkazgan ilovalar.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p>Telefon xotirasi (RAM) kritik chegaraga tushganda, LMK eng yuqori balli (900+) ilovalarni hech qanday ogohlantirishsiz darhol o'ldirib, RAM bo'shatadi!</p>\n</div>",
    "searchText": "Process death: fonda ilova o'ldirilsa Foydalanuvchi o'tkazma summasini kiritdi, kamerani ochdi, tizim ilovani o'ldirdi.  Foydalanuvchi o'tkazma summasini kiritdi, kamerani ochdi, tizim ilovani o'ldirdi.  Process death — tizim fonda turgan ilova jarayonini xotira uchun o'ldirishi. Bu burilishdan farq qiladi: burilishda ViewModel saqlanadi, process death'da  yo'qoladi . Qaytganda foydalanuvchi o'sha ekranni ko'radi (Activity stack tiklanadi), lekin xotiradagi hamma narsa yangi.  Himoya: kichik muhim qiymatlar (id, kiritilgan matn) —  SavedStateHandle  yoki  rememberSaveable ; katta va doimiy ma'lumot — Room yoki DataStore. Tekshirish: Developer options → “Don't keep activities”, yoki ilova fonda turganda  adb shell am kill paket.nomi .  Muhim nuqtalar   Burilish: ViewModel saqlanadi. Process death: ViewModel yo'qoladi.  Kichik qiymat — SavedStateHandle, katta ma'lumot — baza.  Tekshirish — “Don't keep activities” yoki adb shell am kill.   Texnik jihatdan shunday tushuntiring  Process death'da tizim fondagi ilovani o'ldiradi; qaytganda ekran tiklanadi, lekin ViewModel va singleton'lar yangi. Kichik qiymatlarni SavedStateHandle yoki rememberSaveable'da, doimiy ma'lumotni bazada saqlayman va buni Don't keep activities bilan tekshiraman. \n \n   \n     🔬 Senior & Under the Hood \n     Chuqur texnik tahlil, apparat va ichki mexanizmlar \n   \n  \n     Process Death va SavedStateHandle \n     Xotira yetishmaganda Android tizimi butun Linux jarayonini (Process) o'ldiradi. Barcha ViewModel va Singleton'lar o'ladi! Faqat diskka yozilgan  SavedStateHandle  omon qoladi. Shuning uchun muhim ID'larni SavedStateHandle'da saqlash shart. \n  \n "
