    "body": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"background:var(--accent2);border-left:5px solid var(--accent);padding:14px;margin-bottom:18px\">\n  <b style=\"color:var(--accent);font-size:15px\">💡 Amaliyotdagi holat:</b>\n  <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0 0;font-size:15px\">Fonda ish bajarish kerak: biri faylni yuklash, biri har kuni ertalab soat 9 da xabar berish, biri esa musiqani to'xtovsiz ijro etish. Qaysi biri uchun Service, qaysi biri uchun WorkManager ishlatiladi? Android batareya tejash (Doze Mode) tizimi fonga qanday cheklovlar qo'ygan?</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"AN-009-B01\">1. Fon vazifalari qarorlar daraxti (Decision Tree)</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;font-size:14px\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"background:var(--panel2);color:#fff\">\n      <th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Vosita</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Xususiyati</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Kafolat bormi?</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Real amaliy misol</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>WorkManager</b></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Kechiktirilishi mumkin bo'lgan, lekin <b>bajarilishi shart</b> bo'lgan ish</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>100% KAFOLAT!</b> (Telefon o'chib yonsa ham bajariladi)</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Keshni server bilan sinxronizatsiya qilish, analytics yuklash</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>Foreground Service</b></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Foydalanuvchi ko'rib turgan, bevosita hozir bajarilishi shart ish</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Majburiy doimiy notifikatsiya talab qiladi</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Musiqa ijrosi, GPS navigatsiya (Yandex Go)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>AlarmManager</b></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Aynan aniq bir soniyada uyg'onish kerak bo'lgan vazifa</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Vaqtga aniq bog'liq (Exact Alarm)</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Ertalabki Budilnik, Dori ichish eslatmasi</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>Coroutine / Flow</b></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Faqat ilova yoki ekran ochiq turgandagina kerak bo'lgan ish</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Ilova yopilsa bekor bo'ladi</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Ekranda ro'yxatni yuklash, tugma bosilishini kutish</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"AN-009-B02\">2. Doze Mode (Mudroq rejim) nima?</h3>\n<p>Android 6.0 dan boshlab telefon harakatsiz stol ustida tursa va zaryadga ulanmagan bo'lsa, u <b>Doze Mode</b> ga kiradi. Tizim tarmoqni (Wi-Fi/Internet) o'chiradi, oddiy taymerlarni to'xtatadi va CPU ni chuqur uyquga kiritadi. Vaqti-vaqti bilan qisqa \"Maintenance Window\" ochiladi va to'planib qolgan WorkManager ishlari bajarib olinadi.</p>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"AN-009-B03\">3. Boshqalarga buni qanday tushuntirasiz? (Interview Plain-talk)</h3>\n<div class=\"say\">\"Fonda ish bajarish uchun Google tavsiyasi quyidagicha: agar vazifa darhol emas, lekin qachondir albatta bajarilishi shart bo'lsa (deferrable, guaranteed) — <b>WorkManager</b> ishlatiladi (u tarmoq borligi, batareya quvvati kabi cheklovlarni tekshiradi va telefon qayta yonsa ham Room bazasi orqali tiklanadi). Agar vazifa bevosita hozir davom etayotgan va foydalanuvchi undan xabardor bo'lishi shart bo'lsa — doimiy bildirishnoma bilan <b>Foreground Service</b> ishlatiladi. Aniq vaqtdagi eslatmalar uchun esa <b>AlarmManager</b> tanlanadi.\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"deep-section\" id=\"deepSection\">\n  <div class=\"deep-header\">\n    <span class=\"deep-badge\">🔬 Senior darajadagi sir</span>\n    <h4>Android 14 Foreground Service turlari cheklovi</h4>\n  </div>\n  <h4 data-block-id=\"AN-009-D01\">Android 14 dagi o'zgarish: foregroundServiceType</h4>\n  <p>Oldin dasturchilar xohlagan ish uchun Foreground Service ochib qo'yaverishardi. Android 14 dan boshlab har bir Foreground Service uchun Manifest'da uning aniq <b>turi (type)</b> ko'rsatilishi shart qilib qo'yildi:</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><code>camera</code></li>\n    <li><code>mediaPlayback</code></li>\n    <li><code>location</code></li>\n    <li><code>dataSync</code> (bunda ham 6 soatlik cheklov bor)</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p>Agar siz noto'g'ri tur ko'rsatsangiz yoki Google Play tekshiruvida buni isbotlay olmasangiz, ilova do'kondan olib tashlanadi!</p>\n</div>",
    "searchText": "Fon ishi uchun qaysi vosita Savollarga ketma-ket javob bering — to'g'ri vositaga yetib borasiz.  Savollarga ketma-ket javob bering — to'g'ri vositaga yetib borasiz.  Android 8 dan boshlab fon ishlari qattiq cheklangan: batareyani tejash uchun tizim oddiy fon servislarini to'xtatadi. Shuning uchun vositani to'g'ri tanlash kerak. Ekran bilan bog'liq qisqa ish — coroutine; foydalanuvchi ko'radigan uzoq ish — foreground service; kafolatli kechiktirilishi mumkin bo'lgan ish — WorkManager. Aniq vaqtda bajarilishi kerak bo'lgan ish (eslatma) — AlarmManager, lekin u ham cheklangan.  Muhim nuqtalar   Ekranga bog'liq — viewModelScope.  Foydalanuvchi sezadigan uzoq ish — Foreground Service.  Kafolatli, ilova yopilsa ham — WorkManager.   Texnik jihatdan shunday tushuntiring  Ekran ochiqligida kerak bo'lgan ish — viewModelScope'dagi coroutine; foydalanuvchi sezadigan uzoq ish — foreground service; ilova yopilsa yoki qurilma qayta yoqilsa ham kafolatli bajarilishi kerak bo'lgan ish — WorkManager, shartlar va qayta urinish bilan. \n \n   \n     🔬 Senior & Under the Hood \n     Chuqur texnik tahlil, apparat va ichki mexanizmlar \n   \n   Ichki mexanizm va arxitektura \n   Ushbu mavzuning apparat, xotira va OS darajasidagi ta'siri: keraksiz obyektlar yaratilishining oldini olish, kesh registrlaridan unumli foydalanish va to'g'ri arxitektura orqali yuqori tezlikka erishish. \n   Senior darajadagi tavsiya va edge case \n   Bank va yuqori yuklamali tizimlarda bu mexanizm bo'yicha eng muhim e'tibor qaratiladigan nuqta — resurslarni o'z vaqtida tozalash va asinxron poyga holatlarining (race conditions) oldini olishdir. \n "
