    "title": "2-dars. State va recomposition",
    "shortTitle": "2. Recomposition",
    "summary": "Bu darsdan keyin holat o'zgarganda Compose aynan nima qilishini va nega hammasini qayta chizmasligini bilasiz.",
    "origin": "Mavjud qo‘llanmadan",
