    "title": "5-dars. ViewModel + StateFlow + Compose: collectAsStateWithLifecycle",
    "shortTitle": "5. ViewModel bilan",
    "summary": "Bu darsdan keyin Compose'da ekranni boshidan oxirigacha yozib bera olasiz — jonli kod vazifasi uchun.",
    "origin": "Mavjud qo‘llanmadan",
