    "shortTitle": "1. Clean Architecture",
    "summary": "Ko'p dasturchilar barcha kodni — serverga so'rov jo'natish, bazaga yozish va ekranga chiqarishni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri bitt...",
    "origin": "Tech Academy 0 dan Sodda Tushuntirish",
