    "body": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"background:var(--accent2);border-left:5px solid var(--accent);padding:14px;margin-bottom:18px\">\n  <b style=\"color:var(--accent);font-size:15px\">💡 Amaliyotdagi holat:</b>\n  <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0 0;font-size:15px\">Dasturchi sikl ichida <code>var s = \"\"; for(i in 1..10000) s += i</code> deb yozdi. Bu oddiy 3 qatorli kod xotirada <b>10,000 ta yangi obyekt</b> yaratib butun ilovani qotirib qo'ydi! Nega String o'zgarmas (immutable) va StringBuilder bu muammoni qanday yechadi?</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"JV-004-B01\">1. String Constant Pool nima?</h3>\n<p>Dasturlarda eng ko'p ishlatiladigan obyekt — bu matndir (String). Agar har bir <code>\"USD\"</code> degan so'z uchun alohida 24 bayt xotira ajratilsa, xotira to'lib ketadi. Shuning uchun JVM Heap ichida <b>String Constant Pool</b> degan kesh maydoni ochilgan:</p>\n<pre><code>val s1 = \"Toshkent\"\nval s2 = \"Toshkent\"\nprintln(s1 === s2) // TRUE! Ikkisi ham String Pool'dagi BITTA xotira manziliga qaraydi!\n\nval s3 = String(\"Toshkent\".toCharArray())\nprintln(s1 === s3) // FALSE! 'new' orqali Heap'da yangi alohida obyekt ochildi</code></pre>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"JV-004-B02\">2. Nega String Immutability (O'zgarmaslik) qilingan?</h3>\n<ol>\n  <li><b>Xavfsizlik:</b> Bank hisob raqamlari, tarmoq portlari, parollar String'da saqlanadi. Agar uni o'zgartirish mumkin bo'lsa, xaker manzilni boshqa joyga burib yuborishi mumkin edi.</li>\n  <li><b>Thread-Safety:</b> O'zgarmas obyektni 100 ta thread bir vaqtda hech qanday qulfsiz (lock-free) xavfsiz o'qiy oladi.</li>\n  <li><b>HashCode Keshlanishi:</b> String <code>hashCode()</code> ni faqat bir marta hisoblaydi va keshlab qo'yadi. HashMap kaliti sifatida chaqmoqdek tez ishlaydi.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"JV-004-B03\">3. String vs StringBuilder vs StringBuffer</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;font-size:14px\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"background:var(--panel2);color:#fff\">\n      <th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Klass</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">O'zgaruvchanligi</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Thread-safe mi?</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Tezligi</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>String</b></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Immutable (O'zgarmas)</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Ha</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">O'zgartirishlar ko'p bo'lsa juda sekin (har safar yangi obyekt)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>StringBuilder</b></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Mutable (O'zgaruvchan char[])</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">❌ <b>YO'Q</b></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>ENG TEZ!</b> (Bitta threadda matn yig'ish uchun 1-raqamli tanlov)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>StringBuffer</b></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Mutable (O'zgaruvchan char[])</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><b>HA (synchronized)</b></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\">Nisbatan sekinroq (ortiqcha lock overhead)</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"JV-004-B04\">4. Boshqalarga buni qanday tushuntirasiz? (Interview Plain-talk)</h3>\n<div class=\"say\">\"String — bu xavfsizlik, keshlanish va ko'p oqimli xavfsizlik (thread-safety) uchun o'zgarmas qilingan klassdir. U String Constant Pool'da qayta ishlatiladi. Sikllar ichida matnlarni birlashtirishda String o'rniga har doim <code>StringBuilder</code> ishlatilishi shart, aks holda har bir qo'shish amali xotirada yangi obyekt yaratadi. <code>StringBuffer</code> esa eskirgan bo'lib, uning barcha metodlari synchronized qilingan.\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"deep-section\" id=\"deepSection\">\n  <div class=\"deep-header\">\n    <span class=\"deep-badge\">🔬 Senior darajadagi sir</span>\n    <h4>Java 9 Compact Strings va intern() metodi</h4>\n  </div>\n  <h4 data-block-id=\"JV-004-D01\">Java 9 Compact Strings xotirani qanday tejaydi?</h4>\n  <p>Eski Java'da har bir belgi <code>char[]</code> (2 bayt UTF-16) sifatida saqlanar edi. Lekin matnlarning 80% i faqat oddiy lotin harflari (ASCII) bo'lgani uchun har bir harf ortiqcha 1 bayt bo'sh joy olardi.</p>\n  <p>Java 9 dan boshlab <b>Compact Strings</b> kiritildi: endi matn <code>byte[]</code> sifatida saqlanadi. Agar faqat lotin harflari bo'lsa — har bir harf 1 bayt joy oladi va butun ilovadagi String xotirasi <b>50% ga qisqaradi</b>!</p>\n</div>",
    "searchText": "4-dars. Exception'lar, generics, Stream API va Optional  \n\n Exception'lar \n  Throwable  →  Error  (JVM muammolari, ushlanmaydi: OutOfMemoryError) va  Exception .  Checked  (IOException, SQLException) — ushlash yoki  throws  majburiy;  unchecked  (RuntimeException: NullPointerException, IllegalArgumentException) — majburiy emas. Biznes xatolar uchun o'z istisnolarimiz:  class InsufficientFundsException extends RuntimeException . Resurslar  try-with-resources  bilan avtomatik yopiladi:  try (Connection c = ds.getConnection()) { ... } . Qoidalar: istisnoni “yutib” yubormaslik (bo'sh catch), sababni saqlab qayta tashlash ( throw new X(\"...\", e) ), log'da shaxsiy ma'lumot yozmaslik. \n Generics \n Tur xavfsizligi kompilyatsiyada.  Type erasure  — runtime'da generic tur o'chiriladi.  ? extends T  — o'qish (producer),  ? super T  — yozish (consumer) — PECS qoidasi. Kotlin'dagi out/in ning o'zi. \n Stream API va lambda \n BigDecimal total = payments.stream()\n    .filter(p -&gt; p.status() == Status.SUCCESS)\n    .map(Payment::amount)\n    .reduce(BigDecimal.ZERO, BigDecimal::add);\n\nMap&lt;String, List&lt;Payment&gt;&gt; byMerchant = payments.stream()\n    .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(Payment::merchantId)); \n Stream lazy: oraliq operatorlar ( filter ,  map ) yakuniy operator ( collect ,  reduce ,  count ) chaqirilmaguncha ishlamaydi. Stream bir marta ishlatiladi.  parallelStream  — ehtiyotkorlik bilan: umumiy ForkJoinPool, kichik ma'lumotda sekinroq.  Functional interface  — bitta abstrakt metodli interfeys (Function, Predicate, Supplier, Consumer) — lambda shularga mos keladi. \n Optional \n  Optional&lt;Account&gt; findById(id)  — natija bo'lmasligi mumkinligini aniq ko'rsatadi.  orElseThrow(() -&gt; new NotFoundException(id)) ,  map ,  ifPresent . Maydon va parametr sifatida ishlatilmaydi,  get() ni tekshiruvsiz chaqirmaslik. \n Texnik jihatdan shunday tushuntiring \n Checked exception'ni ushlash yoki e'lon qilish majburiy, unchecked — yo'q; biznes xatolar uchun RuntimeException'dan o'z istisnolarimni yarataman, resurslarni try-with-resources bilan yopaman. Stream lazy, yakuniy operatorda ishlaydi; pul yig'indisi uchun BigDecimal bilan reduce. Optional — natija bo'lmasligi mumkin bo'lgan qaytish qiymati uchun. \n\n \n   \n     🔬 Senior & Under the Hood \n     Chuqur texnik tahlil, apparat va ichki mexanizmlar \n   \n   Ichki mexanizm va arxitektura \n   Ushbu mavzuning apparat, xotira va OS darajasidagi ta'siri: keraksiz obyektlar yaratilishining oldini olish, kesh registrlaridan unumli foydalanish va to'g'ri arxitektura orqali yuqori tezlikka erishish. \n   Senior darajadagi tavsiya va edge case \n   Bank va yuqori yuklamali tizimlarda bu mexanizm bo'yicha eng muhim e'tibor qaratiladigan nuqta — resurslarni o'z vaqtida tozalash va asinxron poyga holatlarining (race conditions) oldini olishdir. \n "
