    "body": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"background:var(--accent2);border-left:5px solid var(--accent);padding:14px;margin-bottom:18px\">\n  <b style=\"color:var(--accent);font-size:15px\">💡 Amaliyotdagi holat:</b>\n  <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0 0;font-size:15px\">Ko'p dasturchilar yangi oqim ochish uchun <code>Executors.newFixedThreadPool(10)</code> yoki <code>newCachedThreadPool()</code> deb yozadi. Lekin Senior arxitektorlar nima uchun <code>Executors</code> klassini ishlatishni taqiqlab, faqat to'g'ridan-to'g'ri <code>ThreadPoolExecutor</code> yozishni talab qiladi?</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"JCON-002-B01\">1. Executors.newCachedThreadPool() ning halokatli tuzog'i</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><code>newCachedThreadPool()</code>: Agar 10,000 ta so'rov kelsa, <b>10,000 ta Thread</b> ochadi! Har bir Thread 1 MB Stack olsa, server 1 daqiqada OutOfMemoryError beradi.</li>\n  <li><code>newFixedThreadPool(10)</code>: Threadlar soni 10 ta, lekin uning navbati <code>LinkedBlockingQueue</code> bo'lib, uning chegarasi <b>CHEKSIZDIR (Integer.MAX_VALUE)</b>! Agar so'rovlar ko'payib ketsa, navbat butun RAM ni to'ldirib yuboradi.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"JCON-002-B02\">2. To'g'ri yechim: Aniq chegaralangan ThreadPoolExecutor</h3>\n<pre><code>val executor = ThreadPoolExecutor(\n    4,                      // corePoolSize (Doimiy ishchilar)\n    8,                      // maximumPoolSize (Maksimal ishchilar)\n    60L, TimeUnit.SECONDS,  // keepAliveTime (Ortiqcha ishchilarning kutish vaqti)\n    ArrayBlockingQueue(100),// Navbat CHEGARALANGAN (Maksimal 100 ta vazifa!)\n    ThreadPoolExecutor.AbortPolicy() // 100 tadan oshsa xato ber (Server qulamasin!)\n)</code></pre>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"JCON-002-B03\">3. Deadlock (Turg'un berk ko'cha) nima?</h3>\n<div class=\"say\"><b>Deadlock:</b>\n<br>1. Thread A — 1-hisobni (Lock 1) qulfladi va 2-hisobni qulflamoqchi.\n<br>2. Thread B — 2-hisobni (Lock 2) qulfladi va 1-hisobni qulflamoqchi.\n<br>Ikkala thread ham bir-birining qulfni bo'shatishini kutib, umrbod qotib qoladi! Dastur muzlaydi.\n<br><b>Oldini olish qoidasi:</b> Barcha threadlar resurslarni har doim <b>bitta qat'iy tartibda</b> qulflashi shart (masalan, har doim kichik ID li hisobdan katta ID li hisobga qarab).</div>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"JCON-002-B04\">4. Boshqalarga buni qanday tushuntirasiz? (Interview Plain-talk)</h3>\n<div class=\"say\">\"ThreadPoolExecutor resurslarni tejash uchun threadlar hovuzini boshqaradi. Production tizimlarda cheksiz navbatlar sababli OOM yuz bermasligi uchun har doim chegaralangan BlockingQueue (masalan, ArrayBlockingQueue) va aniq RejectionPolicy (Abort, CallerRuns) bilan maxsus ThreadPoolExecutor tuziladi. Deadlock esa oqimlar bir-birining qulflagan resurslarini o'zaro kutib qolishi natijasida yuzaga keladi va uning oldini olish uchun qulflar har doim bir xil qat'iy iyerarxiya va tartibda olinishi shart.\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"deep-section\" id=\"deepSection\">\n  <div class=\"deep-header\">\n    <span class=\"deep-badge\">🔬 Senior darajadagi sir</span>\n    <h4>ReentrantLock vs synchronized</h4>\n  </div>\n  <h4 data-block-id=\"JCON-002-D01\">Nega ReentrantLock kuchliroq?</h4>\n  <p><code>synchronized</code> bloki moslashuvchan emas: agar qulf bo'sh bo'lmasa, thread majburan abadiy kutadi. <code>ReentrantLock</code> esa qo'shimcha imkoniyatlarni beradi:</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><code>tryLock(5, TimeUnit.SECONDS)</code>: Agar 5 soniyada qulf bo'shamasasa, kutishni to'xtat va boshqa ishni qil (Deadlock bo'lmaydi!);</li>\n    <li><code>lockInterruptibly()</code>: Kutib turgan threadni boshqa threaddan turib bekor qilish (interrupt) mumkin;</li>\n    <li>Fairness: <code>ReentrantLock(true)</code> orqali navbatda eng uzoq kutgan threadga birinchi navbat beriladi (Starvation bo'lmaydi).</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>",
    "searchText": "2-dars. ExecutorService, CompletableFuture va deadlock Bu darsdan keyin thread pool'lar, asinxron kompozitsiya va deadlock haqidagi savollarga javob berasiz. \n\n Bu darsdan keyin thread pool'lar, asinxron kompozitsiya va deadlock haqidagi savollarga javob berasiz. \n Ko'ring \n\n Tushuntirish \n  ExecutorService  — thread'larni qo'lda yaratmasdan,  pool ga vazifa berish.  Executors.newFixedThreadPool(10)  — 10 ta thread; ortiqcha vazifalar navbatda kutadi. Prodakshnda  ThreadPoolExecutor ni aniq sozlash (chegaralangan navbat, rejection policy) yaxshiroq. Ishdan keyin  shutdown()  majburiy.  Future  — natijani keyinroq olish ( get()  bloklaydi). \n  CompletableFuture  — bloklamasdan zanjir qurish: \n CompletableFuture&lt;Balance&gt; b = supplyAsync(() -&gt; balanceService.get(id), pool);\nCompletableFuture&lt;Limits&gt; l  = supplyAsync(() -&gt; limitService.get(id), pool);\nb.thenCombine(l, (bal, lim) -&gt; new Dashboard(bal, lim))\n .orTimeout(3, TimeUnit.SECONDS)\n .exceptionally(e -&gt; Dashboard.empty()); \n Bu Kotlin'dagi ikkita  async  +  await ning Java'dagi ko'rinishi. Executor berilmasa — umumiy ForkJoinPool ishlatiladi; bloklovchi IO uchun o'z pool'ingizni bering. \n  Deadlock  — ikki thread bir-birining lock'ini kutib, abadiy qotib qolishi. To'rt shart: o'zaro istisno, ushlab turib kutish, tortib olib bo'lmaslik,  aylana kutish . Eng oddiy yechim —  lock'larni doim bir xil tartibda olish  (masalan, hisob id bo'yicha kichigidan kattasiga). Yoki  tryLock  timeout bilan. Aniqlash — thread dump ( jstack ). \n  Virtual threads  (Java 21) — juda yengil thread'lar (Kotlin coroutine'lariga o'xshash g'oya): bloklovchi IO kodini minglab parallel so'rov uchun oddiy ko'rinishda yozish mumkin. Spring Boot 3.2+ da  spring.threads.virtual.enabled=true . \n Texnik jihatdan shunday tushuntiring \n Thread'larni qo'lda yaratmayman — ExecutorService va chegaralangan pool, ish tugagach shutdown. Parallel so'rovlar uchun CompletableFuture: supplyAsync, thenCombine, timeout va exceptionally. Deadlock — aylana kutish; uni lock'larni doim bir xil tartibda olish yoki tryLock timeout bilan oldini olaman, aniqlash uchun thread dump. \n O'zingizni tekshiring \n\n\n \n   \n     🔬 Senior & Under the Hood \n     Chuqur texnik tahlil, apparat va ichki mexanizmlar \n   \n   Ichki mexanizm va arxitektura \n   Ushbu mavzuning apparat, xotira va OS darajasidagi ta'siri: keraksiz obyektlar yaratilishining oldini olish, kesh registrlaridan unumli foydalanish va to'g'ri arxitektura orqali yuqori tezlikka erishish. \n   Senior darajadagi tavsiya va edge case \n   Bank va yuqori yuklamali tizimlarda bu mexanizm bo'yicha eng muhim e'tibor qaratiladigan nuqta — resurslarni o'z vaqtida tozalash va asinxron poyga holatlarining (race conditions) oldini olishdir. \n "
