    "shortTitle": "3. Optimallashtirish",
    "summary": "EXPLAIN PLAN orqali so'rov rejasini tahlil qilish: Cost hisoblash, Nested Loops vs Hash Join vs Merge Join tanlovi va Full Table Scan'dan qochish.",
    "origin": "Mavjud qo‘llanmadan",
    "priority": 1,
