    "moduleOrder": 13,
    "title": "3-dars. Oracle PL/SQL: Cursors, Bulk Collect, FORALL va Row Locking",
    "shortTitle": "3. PL/SQL",
    "summary": "Oracle PL/SQL'da xotirani boshqarish: Cursors, Context Switching muammosi, BULK COLLECT, FORALL va SELECT FOR UPDATE qator qulflari.",
    "origin": "Mavjud qo‘llanmadan",
    "priority": 1,
