    "title": "4-dars. Indekslanmagan Foreign Key Qulflari (TM Lock) va Oracle Deadlock Anatomiyasi",
    "shortTitle": "4. TM Locks & Unindexed Foreign Keys",
    "summary": "Nega child jadvaldagi Foreign Key indekslanmasa DELETE yoki UPDATE butun jadvalni qulflaydi (TM Share Lock), va ORA-00060 ning oldini olish.",
