    "shortTitle": "2. @Transactional va Proxy",
    "summary": "Spring @Transactional annotatsiyasining CGLIB proxy mexanizmi, self-invocation (ichki chaqiruv) tuzog'i va tranzaksiya ochilmay qolish sirlari.",
