    "body": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"background:var(--accent2);border-left:5px solid var(--accent);padding:14px;margin-bottom:18px\">\n  <b style=\"color:var(--accent);font-size:15px\">💡 Amaliyotdagi holat:</b>\n  <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0 0;font-size:15px\">Dasturchi metod ustiga <code>@Transactional</code> qo'ydi. Metod ichida xato bo'ldi, lekin ma'lumotlar bazadan orqaga qaytmadi (Rollback bo'lmadi)! Yoki bitta klass ichida oddiy metoddan <code>@Transactional</code> metodni chaqirdi va tranzaksiya umuman ochilmadi! Nega bunday bo'ldi?</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"SP-002-B01\">1. @Transactional qanday ishlaydi? (Spring AOP Proxy siri)</h3>\n<p>Spring sizning klassingizni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri chaqirmaydi! U runtime paytida CGLIB vositasi orqali sizning klassingiz ustiga o'ralgan maxsus <b>Proksi (Proxy)</b> klass yaratadi:</p>\n<pre><code>// Spring yaratgan Proksi klassi:\nclass PaymentServiceProxy extends PaymentService {\n    override fun pay(amount: Long) {\n        try {\n            transactionManager.beginTransaction() // 1. Tranzaksiyani ochadi\n            super.pay(amount)                     // 2. Sizning haqiqiy kodingizni chaqiradi\n            transactionManager.commit()           // 3. Muammo bo'lmasa COMMIT\n        } catch (e: RuntimeException) {\n            transactionManager.rollback()         // 4. Xato bo'lsa ROLLBACK!\n            throw e\n        }\n    }\n}</code></pre>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"SP-002-B02\">2. Ikkita mashhur halokatli tuzoq:</h3>\n<ol>\n  <li><b>Self-Invocation Tuzog'i (O'zini o'zi chaqirish):</b>\n    <br>Agar siz bitta klass ichidagi oddiy <code>fun a()</code> metodidan turib <code>this.b()</code> (bu yerda <code>b()</code> ustida <code>@Transactional</code> bor) ni chaqirsangiz, chaqiruv Proksi orqali EMAS, to'g'ridan-to'g'ri <code>this</code> orqali o'tadi! Natijada <b>@Transactional butunlay ishlamay qoladi</b>!\n  </li>\n  <li><b>Checked Exception Rollback tuzog'i:</b>\n    <br>Sukut bo'yicha Spring faqat <b><code>RuntimeException</code> (Unchecked)</b> kelgandagina Rollback qiladi! Agar sizning kodingizda <code>IOException</code> yoki <code>SQLException</code> (Checked Exception) chiqsa, Spring <b>COMMIT qilib yuboradi!</b>\n    <br><b>To'g'rilash:</b> Har doim <b><code>@Transactional(rollbackFor = [Exception::class])</code></b> deb yozish shart!\n  </li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3 data-block-id=\"SP-002-B03\">3. Boshqalarga buni qanday tushuntirasiz? (Interview Plain-talk)</h3>\n<div class=\"say\">\"@Transactional Spring AOP (Aspect-Oriented Programming) Proksi mexanizmi orqali ishlaydi. Chaqiruvchi Proksi klassiga murojaat qiladi, Proksi tranzaksiyani ochadi va metod yakunida commit yoki rollback qiladi. Bitta klass ichida metoddan metodni chaqirganda (self-invocation) Proksi aylanib o'tilgani sababli tranzaksiya ishlamaydi. Shuningdek, standart bo'yicha faqat RuntimeException da rollback bo'lgani sababli, barcha xatolarni qamrab olish uchun har doim <code>rollbackFor = Exception.class</code> ko'rsatilishi shart.\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"deep-section\" id=\"deepSection\">\n  <div class=\"deep-header\">\n    <span class=\"deep-badge\">🔬 Senior darajadagi sir</span>\n    <h4>Propagation: REQUIRED vs REQUIRES_NEW</h4>\n  </div>\n  <h4 data-block-id=\"SP-002-D01\">Tranzaksiya tarqalishi (Propagation)</h4>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>REQUIRED (Default):</b> Agar mavjud tranzaksiya bo'lsa, o'shanga qo'shiladi. Bo'lmasa yangi ochadi.</li>\n    <li><b>REQUIRES_NEW:</b> Har doim <b>mutlaqo mustaqil yangi tranzaksiya</b> ochadi va ota tranzaksiyani to'xtatib turadi! Masalan, to'lov xato bo'lsa ham audit logini bazaga yozib qolish kerak bo'lsa — audit metodi <code>REQUIRES_NEW</code> qilinadi.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>",
    "searchText": "2-dars. REST API: controller, validatsiya, xatolar  \n\n @RestController\n@RequestMapping(\"/api/v1/transfers\")\n@RequiredArgsConstructor\npublic class TransferController {\n    private final TransferService service;\n\n    @PostMapping\n    public ResponseEntity&lt;TransferResponse&gt; create(\n            @RequestHeader(\"Idempotency-Key\") String key,\n            @Valid @RequestBody TransferRequest req) {\n        TransferResponse res = service.transfer(key, req);\n        return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.CREATED).body(res);\n    }\n}\n\npublic record TransferRequest(\n    @NotNull Long fromAccount,\n    @NotNull Long toAccount,\n    @NotNull @Positive BigDecimal amount) {}\n\n@RestControllerAdvice\npublic class ApiErrors {\n    @ExceptionHandler(InsufficientFundsException.class)\n    public ResponseEntity&lt;ProblemDetail&gt; funds(InsufficientFundsException e) {\n        return ResponseEntity.unprocessableEntity()\n            .body(ProblemDetail.forStatusAndDetail(HttpStatus.UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY, \"Mablag' yetarli emas\"));\n    }\n} \n \n  DTO va Entity  alohida: entity'ni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri qaytarmaslik — ichki maydonlar ochilib qoladi va bazaga bog'lanib qoladi. \n  Validatsiya :  @Valid  + Bean Validation ( @NotNull ,  @Positive ,  @Size ); xato bo'lsa — 400. \n  Global xatolar :  @RestControllerAdvice  +  @ExceptionHandler ; Spring 6'da standart format —  ProblemDetail  (RFC 7807). \n  HTTP kodlar : 200 OK, 201 Created, 204 No Content, 400 noto'g'ri so'rov, 401 autentifikatsiya yo'q, 403 ruxsat yo'q, 404 topilmadi, 409 ziddiyat (masalan, takroriy kalit boshqa ma'lumot bilan), 422 biznes qoida buzildi, 500 server xatosi, 503 vaqtincha mavjud emas. \n  REST : resurslar ot bilan ( /transfers ), amal — HTTP metodi; GET, PUT, DELETE idempotent, POST — yo'q (shuning uchun Idempotency-Key). Versiyalash —  /api/v1 . Hujjat — OpenAPI/Swagger. \n \n Texnik jihatdan shunday tushuntiring \n Controller faqat so'rovni qabul qiladi va validatsiya qiladi — @Valid va DTO record'lar bilan, logika Service'da. Entity tashqariga chiqmaydi. Xatolar @RestControllerAdvice'da markazlashgan va ProblemDetail formatida, to'g'ri HTTP kodlar bilan: validatsiya — 400, biznes qoida — 422, ziddiyat — 409. To'lov POST'ida Idempotency-Key header'i. \n O'zingizni tekshiring \n\n\n \n   \n     🔬 Senior & Under the Hood \n     Chuqur texnik tahlil, apparat va ichki mexanizmlar \n   \n   Ichki mexanizm va arxitektura \n   Ushbu mavzuning apparat, xotira va OS darajasidagi ta'siri: keraksiz obyektlar yaratilishining oldini olish, kesh registrlaridan unumli foydalanish va to'g'ri arxitektura orqali yuqori tezlikka erishish. \n   Senior darajadagi tavsiya va edge case \n   Bank va yuqori yuklamali tizimlarda bu mexanizm bo'yicha eng muhim e'tibor qaratiladigan nuqta — resurslarni o'z vaqtida tozalash va asinxron poyga holatlarining (race conditions) oldini olishdir. \n "
