    "title": "2-dars. Distributed Systems: Two-Phase Commit (2PC) vs SAGA Pattern",
    "shortTitle": "2. To'lov holatlari",
    "summary": "Uzcard, Humo, Payme, Click integratsiyalari bo'yicha tajribangizni tizimli tushuntirish uchun.",
