    "title": "3-dars. High-load Payment Gateway: Rate Limiting, Idempotency va Circuit Breaker",
    "shortTitle": "3. Kafka, Redis",
    "summary": "Yuqori yuklamali to'lov shlyuzlarida barqarorlik: Token Bucket rate limiting, Redis bilan taqsimlangan qulflash va Circuit Breaker (Resilience4j).",
    "origin": "Mavjud qo‘llanmadan",
    "priority": 1,
