    "title": "5-dars. Tranzaksiyalar va Deadlock: ORA-00060, SELECT FOR UPDATE va Balans Xatolari",
    "shortTitle": "5. Deadlock & Balans Hisoblash",
    "summary": "Relyatsion bazalarda (Oracle) Deadlock sabablari, qator darajasidagi qulflar (Row-level lock), Pessimistic vs Optimistic locking va ikki tomonlama buxgalteriya.",
    "origin": "Tech Academy Database Internals",
    "priority": 1,
    "minutes": 30,
