    "title": "3-dars. Java 21+ Virtual Threads (Project Loom) va Spring Boot 3: OS Threads vs Carrier Threads va Pinning Tuzog'i",
    "shortTitle": "3. Virtual Threads (Loom)",
    "summary": "Java 21 va Spring Boot 3.2+ da inqilob yasagan Virtual Threads (Project Loom) mexanizmi, Carrier Threads arxitekturasi, nega 1 ta server 1 000 000 ta blocking so'rovni ko'tara olishi va xavfli 'Pinning' tuzog'i.",
