    "title": "9-dars. MERGE INTO (Upsert): Atomik Insert va Update Bitta So'rovda",
    "shortTitle": "9. MERGE INTO (Upsert)",
    "summary": "Bank hisobvarag'i qoldiqlarini yangilash: IF EXISTS o'rniga bitta atomik MERGE so'rovi, race condition xavfini yo'qotish va 3 barobar yuqori tezlik.",
