    "shortTitle": "11. Dynamic SQL & Hard Parse",
    "summary": "Dinamik SQL xavflari: String ulash (concatenation) nega Shared Pool'ni portlatadi? Hard Parse vs Soft Parse va USING klauzulasi orqali CPU ni 80% tejash.",
    "origin": "core",
