    "title": "12-dars. Bank To'lov Navbatlari (Queue): SELECT FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED",
    "shortTitle": "12. SKIP LOCKED Navbatlar",
    "summary": "RabbitMQ yoki Kafka'siz Oracle ichida yuqori tezlikdagi parallel to'lov navbatini qurish: FOR UPDATE, NOWAIT va SKIP LOCKED orqali o'zaro kutishsiz ishlash.",
    "origin": "core",
